<title>UK: SQUASH-BRITISH OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-BRITISH OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CARDIFF 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results in the</p>
<p>British Open squash championship on Thursday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Men</p>
<p>Dan Jenson (Australia) beat 9-Del Harris (England) 15-5 12-15</p>
<p>10-15 15-14 17-14</p>
<p>7-Ahmed Barada (Egypt) beat Stephen Meads (England) 15-9 15-9</p>
<p>15-9</p>
<p>Women</p>
<p>7-Carol Owens (Australia) beat 16-Philippa Beams (New Zealand)</p>
<p>9-2 9-4 9-1</p>
<p>2-Michelle Martin (Australia) beat 14-Robyn Cooper (Australia)</p>
<p>9-3 9-7 9-5</p>
<p>Men</p>
<p>1-Jansher Khan (Pakistan) beat Joseph Kneipp (Austria) 15-9 15-8</p>
<p>15-9</p>
<p>5-Chris Walker (England) beat David Evans (Wales) 13-15 12-15</p>
<p>15-9 15-6 15-12</p>
<p>Women</p>
<p>Fiona Geaves (England) beat Sabine Schone (Germany) 9-6 10-8 4-9</p>
<p>9-4</p>
<p>12-Jane Martin (England) beat Rachel Grinham (Australia) 9-6 9-2</p>
<p>9-2</p>
</text>
